Source-dropdown selection not possible: the Greenhouse fixture is the inactive-board interstitial (see stage_s4.FAILED); no React-Select combobox, no native <select>, no "How did you hear about us?" widget is in the captured DOM. The browser-use MCP exposes no select_option primitive — selection would have to be driven via browser_click on the combobox + browser_type the option text + Enter, which matches the Greenhouse React-Select pattern documented in ~/.claude/docs/browser-tools.md. Capability is plausible; absence of target makes the stage unreachable on this fixture.
